[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12721.99, "timestamp": "03:32:01", "text": "就像动漫很容易让人产生共鸣一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12723.429, "timestamp": "03:32:03", "text": "它之所以是给孩子用的，仅仅是因为它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12725.71, "timestamp": "03:32:05", "text": "看起来像卡通片。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12728.469, "timestamp": "03:32:08", "text": "是的。而有些人就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12730.07, "timestamp": "03:32:10", "text": "把它当作同类对待。你见过那些吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12731.91, "timestamp": "03:32:11", "text": "就像 Crunchyroll 会议那样，就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12735.349, "timestamp": "03:32:15", "text": "印度人会谈论动漫吗？是的，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12737.51, "timestamp": "03:32:17", "text": "我好像在Instagram上看到过相关的帖子。我"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 12739.825, "timestamp": "03:32:19", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "and then they'd label it as a cartoon"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12739.99, "timestamp": "03:32:19", "text": "还没看过。我的天啊，这太……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12743.67, "timestamp": "03:32:23", "text": "令人难以忍受。我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12745.67, "timestamp": "03:32:25", "text": "他们喜欢谈论动漫，比如，“哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12747.83, "timestamp": "03:32:27", "text": "所以这件事。”然后我就想，“哦，哇。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12752.51, "timestamp": "03:32:32", "text": "兄弟，不是这样的。它和其他任何事物一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12756.74, "timestamp": "03:32:36", "text": "中等的。这只是讲故事的一种方式。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12768.11, "timestamp": "03:32:48", "text": "就像我看到的，就像杰基"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12770.469, "timestamp": "03:32:50", "text": "像 Crunchyroll 那样摇滚起来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12773.309, "timestamp": "03:32:53", "text": "我心想，他为什么会是……"}]